 [CRICKETS CHIRPING]
 [DOG BARKING]

19
00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:49.481
 [HUMMING]

20
00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.884
 [SPRAY HISSING] Hm?

21
00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:56.088
 Well, let's see here.

22
00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:58.123
 "Riliy wuz"...

23
